# Shiridi Sai Enterprises - Frontend Environment Configuration

# Backend API Base URL
# In local development, the Vite dev server proxies /api and /static to http://127.0.0.1:8000
# For production (e.g. deployed on Render), set this to your backend service URL:
# VITE_API_URL=https://shiridi-sai-enterprises-api.onrender.com/api/v1
VITE_API_URL=/api/v1
